{"response": "Hello! I'm your **SCF (Secure Controls Framework) 2026.2 Compliance Assessment Agent**. I'm here to help you navigate cybersecurity governance, risk management, and compliance.\n\nHere's what I can help you with:\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udd0d What I Can Do\n\n| Capability | Example Request |\n|---|---|\n| **Control Lookup** | \"Tell me about control IAC-15\" |\n| **Framework Mapping** | \"Map HIPAA requirements to SCF controls\" |\n| **Maturity Assessment** | \"Assess our IAM maturity \u2014 we have basic AD but no MFA\" |\n| **Gap Analysis** | \"We need PCI DSS 4.0 compliance \u2014 what are we missing?\" |\n| **Compliance Scoping** | \"What controls apply to a foundational security program?\" |\n| **Regulatory Research** | \"Any new HIPAA enforcement actions in 2025?\" |\n| **Threat Intelligence** | \"What CVEs should we prioritize for patch management?\" |\n| **Breach Case Research** | \"What breaches have happened in healthcare due to poor access control?\" |\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcda Coverage\n- **1,534 SCF controls** across **34 domains**\n- **252+ frameworks** including NIST, ISO 27001, HIPAA, PCI DSS, GDPR, NIS2, CMMC, FedRAMP, and more\n- **SCR-CMM maturity levels 0\u20135**\n\n---\n\nWhat would you like to work on today? You can ask a specific question, describe your compliance challenge, or just say something like **\"show me all SCF domains\"** to get started! \ud83d\ude80\n", "session_id": "default", "status": "success"}